ium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T01:25:23-07:00","id":890498,"title":"","content":"p.29 - General Merits, under <b>Drawback</b> says 'Any time a character tries to use one of these merits they must roll the merit\u2019s dot rating as if it were a dice pool.'<br /> <br /> This should read ''Any time a character tries to use one of these merits they must roll the merit's dot rating + a relevant Attribute as a dice pool.'","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-18T23:41:31-07:00","id":893875,"title":"","content":"p. 20 and 28: The Pack Sheet gets mentioned, but it didn't end up in the book (not sure if this is a mistake or if it's getting added as a pdf attachment on drivethru or some such)<br /> p. 22, table: The average dice pool for spirits seems too high?<br /> Back cover: There's an ex